.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Assault Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/953cfdeb2703978b1ab449b991b98989.png","desc":"This shotgun's magazine is optimized for quick combat.\n  •  Greatly increases stability\n  •  Increases rate of fire"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Auto-Loading Holster","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e4262099a1c2cea78b48a6680c5248c9.png","desc":"The holstered weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."},{"name":"Field Prep","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4ee1ecaead6fe2de1a2cab07f8b7be3f.png","desc":"Increases ammo generation. Faster reload, stow, and ready speed when you're crouching."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Ambitious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f93b49c7f10b1be70083f913a3c5d63.png","desc":"Overflows the magazine based on the number of rapid kills before reloading."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Offhand Strike","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/599d73ea677633784655fc4161327c14.png","desc":"Final blows grant additional weapon range, stability, and accuracy when firing from the hip for a short duration."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Envious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bf7fccf6de8ee6d2e9e6285c004a4758.png","desc":"Defeating targets with other weapons before drawing this one transfers ammo to the magazine from reserves. This effect can overflow the magazine based on the number of targets defeated."},{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Firing Line","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/92a5e8dbef32a414709d3196cb815d89.png","desc":"This weapon deals increased precision damage when near two or more allies."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Killing Tally","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a64f5d3e972ea35b1789f62999235083.png","desc":"Kills increase this weapon's damage until it is stowed or reloaded."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Adaptive Munitions","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3b952f8ba0c9afce1a0cc081d23ece03.png","desc":"This weapon adapts its damage output and effectiveness against energy shields that don't match the weapon's damage type."},{"name":"Cascade Point","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/fd17b30233d244fc7115315633906f6a.png","desc":"Final blows or sustained precision hits with another weapon increase this weapon's rate of fire for a short duration."},{"name":"Bait and Switch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc91e95edfbc9163dd88339a93b66913.png","desc":"Deal damage with all equipped weapons within a short time to give this weapon a damage boost."},{"name":"Burning Ambition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f7a2484668486f64020a612bd3dd5ab9.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage scorches the target. Dealing damage to a scorched target inflicts scorch."},{"name":"Onslaught","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7e07db21ba2b35751507256e46230616.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase its rate of fire."},{"name":"Target Lock","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/72be46e05195a95ae1307a684f68456b.png","desc":"Damage increases the longer this weapon remains on a target."}]